Subject: [PATCH] fix(db): version legacy preference columns

Add a tracked migration for databases created before cooldown metadata existed.
Use the repository migration runner and validate schema before deployment.

--- /dev/null
+++ b/database/migrations/add_preference_cooldown_columns.sql
@@
+ALTER TABLE user_player_preferences ADD COLUMN preference_type TEXT DEFAULT 'preference';
+ALTER TABLE user_player_preferences ADD COLUMN expires_at INTEGER;
+
+CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_user_player_preferences_cooldown
+ON user_player_preferences(user_id, league_id, preference_type, expires_at);
*** End Patch
